    "labels outside the check's languages (Bodo, Kashmiri, Dogri ...) are no evidence on their own: IndicLID gives them to plain Hindi news lines; the marker words decide",
    "a document under min_letters_to_flag (100) letters where IndicLID disagrees is 'short_disagree', not 'uncertain'; min_letters stays 20, so every document is still judged",
